I lack current USD/CAD price data for November 2026, so I'll estimate based on typical volatility. USD/CAD has traded roughly in the 1.25–1.45 range in recent years; reaching 1.45 at any hourly high within the remaining ~8 weeks requires a substantial move from prevailing levels, which I don't know. Without a known spot price near 1.45, the probability is low, perhaps around 5–10%.

Expected value of preparing: 0.07 × $100 − $65 ≈ −$58, so do not prepare.

